    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「LLaVA」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "纯语言指令微调已经让助手更容易被自然语言控制，而视觉语言模型仍常围绕图像描述或问答等固定任务训练。LLaVA 以刻意简洁的连接架构，把指令跟随范式带入基于图像的对话。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-visual-instruction-data",
                "claim-two-stage"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "一个可学习线性投影把 CLIP 视觉特征映射到大语言模型的 token 嵌入空间。GPT-4 生成的合成对话提供指令数据，两阶段训练先对齐模态，再微调整体助手完成多模态对话。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-visual-instruction-data",
                "claim-two-stage"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 LLaVA 视为开放视觉指令微调的基础方案，因为它把简洁架构、可复现的数据生成和代码结合起来。它推动了开放多模态助手快速扩张，也影响了后来对编码器、连接器、数据混合与视觉推理的改进。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-visual-instruction-data",
                "claim-two-stage"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「LLaVA」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
